From 70a11510ae2d84492096bd6e9d3cb8860e4d561a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Avery Felts <averyfelts@aol.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 15:51:16 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 08/20] MSL: Add logic operations through framebuffer fetch

Options::logic_op (VkLogicOp + 1) and logic_op_attachment_kinds (4 bits per color location)
apply the logic operation to fragment outputs on the attachment's bits, read through
[[color(n)]]: normalized formats on their fixed-point encoding, integer formats masked to
the channel width (Metal clamps out-of-range integer outputs) and sign-extended for SINT.
---
 main.cpp      |   9 ++++
 spirv_msl.cpp | 113 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 spirv_msl.hpp |  25 +++++++++++
 3 files changed, 147 insertions(+)

